		<section deliveryTarget="except_digital">
			<title>Simple operation</title>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>Touch the Driver Only icon. Air mostly blows in the driver’s seat.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>If no passenger in the front passenger seat, energy consumption will be reduced.</p>
		</section>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>Touch the Driver Only icon. Air mostly blows in the driver’s seat.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Use this icon when no one is in the passenger seat, so you can reduce energy consumption.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
